  "supplementary": [
    "Students admitted to the Food and Nutritional Sciences through the broad-based admission scheme may apply to specialize in the Nutritionist Stream by the end of second term in their second year of attendance. Students applying to specialize in this stream must have obtained (1) a GPA of 3.3 or above; (2) an overall result of at least 6.5 in IELTS with no less than 6.0 in each component; (3) at least a C in FNSC2005; and (4) recommendation from the selection panel. The minimum unit requirement for the Nutritionist Stream is 66.",
    "Nutritionist Stream",
    "Students are required to complete a minimum of 66 units of courses as follows:",
    "1. Faculty Package:",
    "Group A: LSCI1002 Group B: CHEM1280 (preferred) or 1070",
    "A course from the following Group C: MATH1520 (preferred) or 1010 Group D: (PHYS1001 or 1002) (preferred) or 1111 Group E: STAT1012 (preferred) or 1011",
    "2. Required Courses:",
    "BCHE2030#, BIOL2120#, 2410#, FNSC2001, 2002, 2005, 3001, 3002, 3010, 3030, 3110, 4001, 4002, 4101, 4102, 4110, 4120, 4150, 4160, 4170, LSCI2002#",
    "3. Capstone Courses:",
    "FNSC4906, 4907",
    "Total: 66",
    "In addition to fulfilling the above Major Programme Requirement, students meeting the criteria as specified by the Faculty can take the following stream offered by the Faculty:",
    "Science, Technology And Research Stream",
    "Students are required to complete a minimum of 12 units of courses as follows:",
    "1. Required Courses:",
    "(a) One Faculty Package Course:",
    "Choose from the two remaining groups of the Faculty Package that have not been used to fulfill the Faculty Package Requirement",
    "(b) Research Courses:",
    "STAR2000, 3000, 4000[b]",
    "(c) Seminar Courses:",
    "STAR2050, 3050, 4050",
    "2. Experiential Learning:",
    "At least 4 consecutive weeks of outside Hong Kong exposure[c]",
    "Total: 12"
  ],
